# OpenBridge Environment Variables
#
# This file is auto-generated by the setup wizard when you run:
#   openbridge start
#
# The wizard walks you through creating your Slack/Discord app,
# entering tokens, and verifying they work. You don't need to
# edit this file manually.
#
# The generated file is saved as .env.local (which is gitignored).
#
# If you need to edit tokens later, modify .env.local directly.

# --- Slack (Socket Mode) ---
# SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-...
# SLACK_APP_TOKEN=xapp-...

# --- Discord ---
# DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN=...
# Note: The Application (Client) ID is auto-extracted from the bot token for slash command registration.
